Z||000000||BroCar 87||06-12-2000||05:06 PM||||This morning on my way to work, I see an earlier model coupe (white) ahead of me. So of course, I try to catch up as quick as I can. I get behind them and it looks like a guy, so I pull out my wallet and get one of my Pennock's Fiero Forum Business Cards ready. Well, I finally get up next to them and its a LADY. NOT TOO BAD LOOKIN EITHER  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">But I am only 18 and she looked 30 or so... So I make it look like I was checkin out her car as she glanced at mine... then I get held up in traffic.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif">  So then i catch up to her again and get in front of her. And we're just cruising. <BR>Somehow we got stopped at a red light next to each other and she just kept edging forward...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif"> I wanted to talk to her, at least find out a little about the other iron duck. So anyways, there was a truck on the right of me and her on the left, ANXIOUSLY they both edged forward and I look over to the truck and he nodded "ohh no, I am going to have to bite on this one" (race)<BR>So the light turns green and we all haul @$$. The truck falls way behind and I finally gave it all my gas... and blew her away too. Its a shame    a shame i tell you. She didn't even look interested in her CARS let alone Fiero's. <BR>Oh well I know that there is about 1140 people interested  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> ||||reg||9
